  The younger sister, Anita, overcame great financial difficulties and the many problems of being a student in wartime Germany, to become a skilled medical doctor. She practiced successfully until her retirement in 1982. Martina, with the same talents, attended al sorts of training courses. She had many jobs, but failed in every respect.
